    {
      "bbox": [
        205,
        757,
        1513,
        870
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, New Yorkers face a crisis of affordability and are often misled by junk fee pricing on goods and services, where one price is advertised but a different, higher price is charged at checkout; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2538,
          "min": -1.3676
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0002
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 40,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0047
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5788,
        "area_px": 147288,
        "density": 0.0393,
        "chars": 203,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 35.07
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        205,
        911,
        1513,
        1028
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, hidden junk fee pricing is harmful to New Yorkers because junk fee pricing hides mandatory extra charges until the end of checkout, making the initial price seem lower than what is ultimately charged; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.172,
          "min": -1.0983
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 39,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0017
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7044,
        "area_px": 151164,
        "density": 0.0466,
        "chars": 213,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 30.24
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        205,
        1066,
        1513,
        1182
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, as a matter of basic fairness and honest business practice, New Yorkers deserve clear and transparent information about goods and services, including the full cost, before deciding whether to purchase such goods and services; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1655,
          "min": -1.1566
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 42,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0003
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7496,
        "area_px": 149872,
        "density": 0.05002,
        "chars": 238,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 31.75
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        205,
        1220,
        1513,
        1334
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, honest businesses that do not use junk fee pricing are at a competitive disadvantage and are undermined when bad actors use junk fee pricing to deceive customers with artificially low prices; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1352,
          "min": -1.1838
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 36,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0008
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5687,
        "area_px": 147288,
        "density": 0.03861,
        "chars": 204,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 35.87
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        202,
        1373,
        1513,
        1489
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City is committed to deploying all available resources to promote business practices that help New Yorkers make informed decisions when purchasing goods and services, thereby advancing affordability for all New Yorkers; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2295,
          "min": -1.2479
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
